BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:PlayYourCourt Santa Rosa Tennis
UID:event_315463387@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260718T014929Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T210000
SUMMARY:Fun & easy way to play more tennis (please read event description 
 for details)
DESCRIPTION:PlayYourCourt Santa Rosa Tennis\nWe’re still working to get 
 more people into these Meetups\, but our goal is to give PlayYourCourt mem
 bers a few social tennis outings each week in addition to your practice se
 ssions and Challenge League matches.\n\nThese Meetups are co-ed\, super la
 id back\, and all skill levels are welcome. Post your skill level and a su
 ggested court in the comments section so we can round up as many players a
 s we can for some tennis fun!\n\nAlso\, if you’re looking to meet new pr
 actice partners or play some matches and you aren’t already in the PlayY
 ourCourt Community\, you can go here to see what we’re all about and sig
 n up:\n\nhttps://www.playyourcourt.com/tennis-community/meetup/santa-rosa-
 ca/\n\nIf you love tennis\, we’d love to have you! Be sure and watch the
  quick video that explains how everything works.\n\nHappy hitting!\n\n- Sc
 ott
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/playyourcourt-santa-rosa-tennis/event
 s/315463387/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260629T021629Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260629T021629Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
